@title Closed-loop winch: an open coil on one STO channel is found and trips the drive after the discrepancy time
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane L2c. Simulate > Defects and walk-throughs (which switches Live on) opens the coil of STO channel 1,
# then Simulate > Drive run starts the winch. The two channels disagree, the drive latches the
# discrepancy after its time (1 s) and the run lists it.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch.novo
wait 20
click_text Simulate
wait 5
click_text "Defects and walk-throughs"
wait 20
click_text "Contact welded closed"
wait 5
click_text "Coil open (never operates)"
wait 5
click_text "choose..."
wait 5
click_text "=A1+CAB-STOA"
wait 5
click_text "Inject defect"
wait 20
expect "DEFECT INJECTED"
shot defect-injected
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 400
expect "Safe torque off channels disagree"
shot sto-discrepancy-found
check_layout
